Hi,

Please join us for our OP US/Europe/Brazil conference call:

(1) April 2017 - US/Europe/Brazil - OP Monthly Meeting
    - Note - Brasilia Summer Time ends on 19 February 2017
    - Note - US Daylight Savings Time starts on 12 March 2017
    - Note - Europe Summer Time starts on 26 March 2017
    - Note - SAE World Congress in Detroit, MI is on 4-6 April 2017
    - Note - Joint PWG/OP Summit as Virtual F2F is on 25-27 April 2017
    - Tuesday 11 April 2017, Daytime
      - US
        9am in San Francisco - US PDT (Pacific Daylight Time)
        10am in Colorado - US MDT (Mountain Daylight Time)
        11am in Chicago - US CDT (Central Daylight Time)
        12pm in New York - US EDT (Eastern Daylight Time)
      - Europe
        6pm in Berlin - CEST (Central Europe Summer Time)
      - Brazil
        1pm in Belo Horizonte - BRT (Brasilia Time)

    US:  +1 641-715-3814
    Germany:  +49 (0) 221 98203421
    Brazil:  +55 61 4040-4460
    Japan:  +81 (0) 3-5050-5070
    Participant Access Code:  622393#

    (note that local numbers for many other countries are available,
